ep800 (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix disconnect vs vb2 release deadlock (VLC/Ctrl+C hang, D-state unbind).
  * Defer workqueue cancel; null udev so I/O fails fast on unplug.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:40:00 +0200

ep800 (1.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Decode frames in a workqueue instead of USB URB softirq (host freeze).
  * Keep V4L2 input/parm ioctls for VLC/FFmpeg compatibility.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 18:20:00 +0200

ep800 (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add V4L2 input and parm ioctls so VLC/FFmpeg can open the device.

